<title>THAILAND: Credit Lyonnais proposes to up stake in Thai firm.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais proposes to up stake in Thai firm.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Siam City Credit Finance and Securities Plc said on Wednesday Credit Lyonnais Securities (Asia) had proposed to raise its stake in the firm to 45 percent from the current 30 percent.</p>
<p>Credit Lyonnais will be able to increase its holdings in the security firm after Siam City Credit splits its securities and finance businesses, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The separation is expected to be completed by the end of this year, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
